rue] [17592186725551 1071 "**(c)** Find the limiting concentration as time tends to infinity. Concentration $=$ {{concentration}} kg/L." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725551 1072 #uuid "1a1f50a0-d592-5b5a-9969-b1155e1424b8" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725551 1074 "As $t\\to\\infty$, $Q(t)\\to50$ kg. Divide by 1000 L: the limiting concentration is $0.05$ kg/L, equal to the inflow concentration." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186725708 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725552 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725552 1077 "v" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725552 1078 #edb/ref 17592186725708 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725552 1079 #uuid "1a39b475-6153-594e-8678-ccb24681ee0b" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725553 1058 #edb/ref 17592186725582 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725553 1062 #uuid "1a8ca6b7-7029-5a9a-a9f0-58a7995e93bb" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725553 1063 #edb/ref 17592186725659 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725554 1080 "On an interval where velocity can be regarded as a function of position, the chain rule gives $x\\!\\prime\\!\\prime=dv/dt=(dv/dx)(dx/dt)=v\\,dv/dx$. Thus $mv\\,dv/dx=-kx$, or $mv\\,dv=-kx\\,dx$." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725554 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725554 1083 #uuid "1b1f585f-af17-55e2-ae7b-47a01dfea635" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725555 1075 #edb/ref 17592186725711 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725555 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725555 1077 "time" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725555 1078 #edb/ref 17592186725711 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725555 1079 #uuid "1d92b949-8127-57c9-a41f-8210eeaa2eb7" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725556 1068 #edb/ref 17592186725710 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725556 1071 "**(a)** What will it read after **4 more minutes** (after the first minute)? Temperature $=$ {{temperature}} degrees Celsius." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725556 1072 #uuid "1e48d5dc-682b-53ed-a559-732e6f5e8e65" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725556 1074 "Newton cooling gives $T=-1+23e^{-kt}$. At $t=1$, $13=23e^{-k}$, so $T(t)=-1+23(13/23)^t$. Four more minutes after the first minute means $t=5$, giving $T(5)=-1+23(13/23)^5\\approx0.3268$ °C." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725557 1062 #uuid "1e82078b-eda5-58ab-ae6d-5efe89301966" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725557 1063 #edb/ref 17592186725546 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725558 1062 #uuid "1f17963a-640b-55ba-bc49-2ecc69581359" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725558 1063 #edb/ref 17592186725576 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725559 1058 #edb/ref 17592186725732 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725559 1062 #uuid "21629fe9-f95c-5f35-aac9-a1abf103181c" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725559 1063 #edb/ref 17592186725560 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725560 1068 #edb/ref 17592186725538 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725560 1071 "**(b)** What is the population after 5 hours? Population $=$ {{population}}." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725560 1072 #uuid "22e3bfc7-f450-5ead-8438-01b251ae46ff" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725560 1074 "$P(5)=340\\cdot4^{5/4}=1360\\sqrt2\\approx1923.33$. If reporting a whole-number model estimate, this is about 1,923 bacteria." 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725561 1075 #edb/ref 17592186725536 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725561 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725561 1077 "temperature" 13194139542354 17592186502323 true] [17592186725561 1078 #edb/ref 17